    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seyahat: A Journey to Mecca</strong> is a unique free-to-play 2D RPG which is designed as an educational tool to help players and students to engage with the cultural history of the seventeenth-century Ottoman Empire and Islamic world.<strong> Seyahat</strong> will introduce the player to this world through Ottoman painting inspired art design and stories inspired by historical primary sources.<strong> Seyahat</strong> serves as the inspired remake of the Twine free-to-play game<strong> The Hajj Trail</strong>.</p>",
